#!/usr/bin/env python3
# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
"""
bhai - Termux storage agent (Build Studio bridge)
=================================================
Aapke phone ke storage ko Arena chat se jodta hai. No API, no server, no setup.

    [ main / Arena chat ]  --commit-->  [ GitHub repo (public) ]  --git pull-->  [ bhai @ Termux ]  --ops-->  [ /sdcard ]
    [                          <--git push / attach report--                        ]

Chalane ke liye sirf python3 (stdlib) aur git chahiye. Bas.

Commands
--------
  bhai              same as `bhai sync`
  bhai sync         repo se naye tasks kheenchke lagaao, report do
  bhai watch [sec]  agent mode: har N sec me sync (default 30)
  bhai run [ID|-]   ek task chalao (ID = tasks/*.json ka naam, '-' = stdin se JSON)
  bhai up PATH...   file/folder staging karo taaki main use edit kar sakun (-g = push bhi)
  bhai down [PATH]  mere edits ko original phone location par wapas rakh do
  bhai push         upload/ + out/ ko repo me commit+push karo
  bhai ls [DIR]     listing (sizes/mtimes)
  bhai find GLOB    phone storage me dhoondo
  bhai du [DIR]     space ka hisaab + sabse bhaari files
  bhai report       pichhla report paste-ready text me (clipboard me bhi, agar termux-api ho)
  bhai log [n]      agent log
  bhai doctor       setup check (storage perms, git, network, branch)
  bhai auth TOKEN   (optional) push-back enable karo; `bhai auth off`
  bhai boot on|off  Termux:Boot ke saath watch auto-start
  bhai config K=V   config set/dekho
  bhai selfupdate   agent code update
  bhai hello        ek demo task chalake dekho ki loop kaam kar raha hai
  bhai uninstall    symlink + state hatao (phone ka koi file delete NAHI karega)

Safety rails
------------
  Git optional hai: git na bhi ho to agent repo ka tarball seedha https se
  kheench leta hai (bhai config SYNC_MODE=http). Sirf python3 chahiye, bas.

  * Write/delete sirf in roots ke andar: /sdcard (shared), $HOME, ~/.bhai, /tmp, repo.
  * `delete` hard-delete nahi karta -> ~/.bhai/trash/<time>/ me chala jaata hai (`--force` ke bina).
  * `bhai run --dry` / `bhai sync --dry` = sirf dikhayega, kuch badlega nahi.
  * Task JSON me "confirm":"<phrase>" ho to terminal par type karke confirm karna padega.
"""

